## 3. Closed-Loop Communication

When a task is complete, your summary must follow this format:

> "I updated `[file]` to [what changed and why]."
> "I verified by [specific action: screenshot / curl output / svelte-check result / Redis read-back]."
> "Result: [what was confirmed — no type errors / endpoint returned `{ success: true }` / layout matches design / Redis key updated correctly]."

If the dev server is not running, start it with `npm run dev` before attempting any browser or endpoint verification.
